## 数据源归属 (Data source attribution)

This project aggregates public data from multiple sources. The compiled
DuckDB file (`data/bebd.duckdb`) is a derivative work of:

1. **EU CosIng** — European Commission, CosIng Database
   (https://ec.europa.eu/growth/tools-databases/cosing/)
   Subject to: Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009
2. **EU Annexes II–VI** — Open Beauty Facts mirror of EU Cosmetics Regulation
   (https://github.com/openfoodfacts/openbeautyfacts)
   License: Database contents available under
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
3. **INCIDB samples** — INCIDB/cosmetics-skincare-inci-database
   (https://github.com/INCIDB/cosmetics-skincare-inci-database)
   License: MIT
4. **BEBD** — Beauty Engineering Big Data (bebd.bevol.com)
   Use subject to their Terms of Service; we use only public sitemap URLs.
5. **openFDA Cosmetic Events** — U.S. Food and Drug Administration
   (https://api.fda.gov/cosmetic/event.json)
   Public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105)

The MIT License above covers only the original code, scripts, and integration
in this repository. It does NOT supersede the original terms of the data
sources listed above. When redistributing or republishing data derived from
this project, you must comply with each source's own terms.
